{"v":4,"catch":"滿車，零耐心。","desc":"Supermarket Manager 2025 將您自己的雜貨店鑰匙交給您，並由您將它打造成附近居民最喜歡的購物地點。\n\n從最基本的設定開始，一步一步往上爬。擺放貨架、整理佈局、調整價格，讓顧客流連忘返。隨著人潮增加，擴大空間、升級設備，讓一切運作順利。\n\n聘請合適的員工、分配角色，並管理零售生活的日常混亂。從乾淨的走道到長長的結帳隊伍，每一個決定都很重要。\n\n這是您的店面、您的策略，也是您建立零售王國的機會，只要準備好每天至少回答 47 次「廁所在哪裡？","publisher":"DubassGames","release":"2025-07-03","genres":["模擬"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.9GB / Switch 0.9GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/db94ae4759ca7f1f82f8ec8bfd94c4fc2430e5ef1877fb250fe5157c073c2db0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/be6998cd7d0e41063bd6b04ae42a1300b892efe70f89e2bd6f40079dbdc3b997.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/81af006fe4786f52de3a1a9d2da6c157866e3c0b824980f0d06ef4f8b59e190a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/392fc80d45f87097e11415a64699270cb1e28f2eacdb77d9570925c857c11029.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0077e780646bb86731692d5210b314e5478b2d1137cba90aa948847579cc211f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/653abe39a22d22f34f47bcd3c507ab34830dc842e683132a78e91fa0e9c0b697.jpg"],"titleId":"010040e0241de000","dlc":[]}